  "content": "#sunilminglani #harshadmehta #trumptariffs #indianeconomy \nIn this video, Sunil Minglani draws powerful parallels between the Harshad Mehta era of the 1990s and today’s Indian stock market, highlighting how history can often repeat itself. He explains patterns that led to a massive bull run back then and that could play out again in today’s environment. The discussion delves deeper into whether we can expect a significant rise and subsequent crash in the coming days, and how retail investors should prepare themselves for both scenarios.\n\nSunil also addresses the growing concerns around SIP inflows, questioning whether short-term economic pressures could disrupt the steady stream of money into mutual funds. Alongside this, he analyses current global affairs, including the slowdown in the US economy and the uncertainty created by Donald Trump’s tariff policies, and how these external factors could directly impact the Indian stock market....... Watch and never forget to share it with needy people 🙏\n\n#stockmarketforbeginners #psychologymatters  #harshadmehtascam #scam1992 #investment #retailinvestors #donaldtrump #useconomy  #indianstockmarket #stockmarketindia #sharemarket #sharemarketnews #sharebazaar #stockmarketinvesting #bullrun #stockmarketcrash \n============================================================\nDemat account with Zerodha, , please register using the link below... \nhttps://zerodha.com/open-account?c=ZM...\n============================================================\nTo subscribe to Master Trader Online, Please Visit the link below OR download the SM Android Application from the Google Play Store\nhttps://sunilminglani.com/index.php/w...\n*Call/WhatsApp at 8882424222 / 8585954095 /9711830634 or email at teamsunilminglani@gmail.com for any queries.\n============================================================\n✔ Android Application Link: https://play.google.com/store/apps/de...\n✔ iOS Application Link- https://apps.apple.com/in/app/